               <string>&lt;b&gt;For each REM&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br/&gt;• events file: the REM events in the Snooz annotation format&lt;br/&gt;• summary file: start, peak and end times, duration, absolute amplitude of LOC and ROC at the peak of the REM (µV), absolute rise and fall slopes of LOC and ROC (µV/s)</string>
