            </item>
            <item>
             <widget class="QLabel" name="label_2">
              <property name="text">
               <string>&lt;b&gt;For the cohort&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br/&gt;• REM count&lt;br/&gt;• duration of the REMs (s)&lt;br/&gt;• amplitude of the REMs: difference between the peak and the trough of LOC − ROC&lt;br/&gt;• density of the REMs per sleep cycle and per hour&lt;br/&gt;• variability of the densities&lt;br/&gt;• percentage of phasic and tonic REM sleep&lt;br/&gt;• peak-to-peak energy (µV²)&lt;br/&gt;• peak-to-peak activity index&lt;br/&gt;The averages are reported:&lt;br/&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;– total (all night)&lt;br/&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;– per sleep cycle&lt;br/&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;– per clock hour&lt;br/&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;– per hour spent in each stage</string>
